  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘 실험은 원형 코일 중심의 자기장 세기에 대한 실험입니다!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf71a5dcbec23c6bb385e7d827cdefaf7fdcb451\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf71a5dcbec23c6bb385e7d827cdefaf7fdcb451\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d92997d09ee6d5129e407089d8078d17e7d887d1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d92997d09ee6d5129e407089d8078d17e7d887d1\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아 스스로봐도 봐도 실험 결과가 너무 잘나와서 <br>뿌듯하다!!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/130c36f466e2b1acbc3ad2fe9cb22d9d0a886e2e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/130c36f466e2b1acbc3ad2fe9cb22d9d0a886e2e\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[주의] 구리선 안됨!<br>그러면 전류가 N배가 되지 않음!.</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0a9517747664352668f64477f622b2e72ce3e2d\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0a9517747664352668f64477f622b2e72ce3e2d\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/84567a12424ed5f6b82985356baf7b2cdc2b9f47\" data-origin-width=\"2992\" data-origin-height=\"2992\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/84567a12424ed5f6b82985356baf7b2cdc2b9f47\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">구리선으로 하려면, 이렇게 종이끼면 되긴 하는데<br>에나멜선으로 하는게 맞는 것 같아요!<br><br>구리선으로 하면, 선끼리 접촉해서 오히려 전선이 더 큰 단면적으로 느껴져서 전류량이 줄어드는 효과랑<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8061999f1417a87dccc7a4c1cb55420238a392f9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8061999f1417a87dccc7a4c1cb55420238a392f9\" data-origin-width=\"603\" data-origin-height=\"887\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">중앙에 자기장이 상쇄되는 현상이 발생해서<br>자기장이 측정이 안되는 것 같아요<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dwcMvH/dJMb8XR4U1X/dIpvK1ldKCwEt0jRvo2ZNK/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dwcMvH/dJMb8XR4U1X/dIpvK1ldKCwEt0jRvo2ZNK/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미